    <string name="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</string>
    <string name="faq_create_modpack">How to create a modpack?</string>
    <string name="faq_create_modpack_answer">Press the "Create" button in the bottom navigation bar and select "Create modpack".</string>
    <string name="faq_add_favorite">How to add a project to favorites?</string>
    <string name="faq_add_favorite_answer">Open the project page and tap the bookmark icon in the top right corner.</string>
    <string name="faq_change_theme">How to change the app theme?</string>
    <string name="faq_change_theme_answer">Go to "Settings" and tap the theme icon to switch between light and dark theme.</string>
    <string name="social_networks">Social networks for feedback</string>
    <string name="faq_install_zip">How to install a modpack in Minecraft? .zip</string>
    <string name="faq_install_zip_answer">1. Download the .zip modpack file \n2. Open Minecraft Launcher\n3. Navigate to .minecraft/mods folder\n4. Place the modpack file in this folder\n5. Launch Minecraft with the required version\n6. Wait for all mods to load</string>
    <string name="faq_install_mrpack">How to install a modpack in Minecraft? .mrpack</string>
    <string name="faq_install_mrpack_answer">1. Install Modrinth launcher \n2. Download the .mrpack file\n3. Open the file and wait for mods to install \n4. Click the play button</string>
    <string name="faq_minecraft_folder">Where is the .minecraft folder?</string>
    <string name="faq_minecraft_folder_answer">Windows: %APPDATA%\\.minecraft\nMac: ~/Library/Application Support/minecraft\nLinux: ~/.minecraft</string>
    <string name="faq_minecraft_version">Which Minecraft version should I use?</string>
    <string name="faq_minecraft_version_answer">The version depends on the modpack. Check the modpack description - it specifies the compatible Minecraft version. Make sure you have that exact version installed.</string>
    <string name="faq_mods_not_loading">What to do if mods don\'t load?</string>
    <string name="faq_mods_not_loading_answer">1. Check Minecraft version\n2. Make sure Forge/Fabric is installed\n3. Delete the mods folder and reinstall the modpack\n4. Check available disk space\n5. Restart your computer</string>
    <string name="faq_update_modpack">How to update a modpack?</string>
    <string name="faq_update_modpack_answer">1. Delete old mods files\n2. Download the new modpack version\n3. Place new files in the mods folder\n4. Launch Minecraft</string>
    <string name="faq_ram_requirements">How much RAM is needed?</string>
    <string name="faq_ram_requirements_answer">Minimum 4GB for stable performance. Recommended 6-8GB for comfortable gameplay with many mods.</string>

