    <!-- Release Description -->
    <string name="release_short_description" translatable="false">NexusForge - modpack builder for creating working Minecraft modpacks</string>
    <string name="release_full_description" translatable="false">NexusForge is a powerful modpack builder that allows you to easily create and manage Minecraft modpacks right from your phone or tablet.

Key features:
• Create your own modpacks with an intuitive interface
• Choose from thousands of mods and plugins for any Minecraft version
• Manage your builds and save them to the cloud
• Export modpacks in various formats (.mrpack, ZIP)
• Use ready-made templates for quick start
• Sync your projects between devices
• Support for all popular mod loaders (Forge, Fabric, Quilt)
• Dark and light theme
• Support for Russian, English and other languages

NexusForge makes creating modpacks accessible to everyone - from beginners to experienced players. Start creating your perfect modpack right now!</string>
